      <p>For supported platforms, the Machine Config Operator (MCO) can manage and update the boot image on each node to ensure the Red Hat Enterprise Linux CoreOS (RHCOS) version of the boot image matches the Red Hat Enterprise Linux CoreOS (RHCOS) version appropriate for your cluster.</p>
